<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>6.2.6: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01588</md:content-id>
    <md:title>6.2.6: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>0365bc61-c5a2-46da-b940-ceb461ac729c</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para><emphasis><emphasis>Students will complete the following questions to practice the skills they have learned in this lesson.</emphasis></emphasis></para>
<para>For questions 1 – 8, simplify each expression completely. </para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((5h^2)(-3h^2)\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(-15h^2\)</item>
  <item>\(-15h^4\)</item>
  <item>\(-15h\)</item>
  <item>\(-15h^8\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(-15h^4\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="2" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((-\frac45d^2s^2)(6ds^2)\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(-\frac{24}{5}d^2s^4\)</item>
  <item>\(-\frac{24}{30}d^2s^4\)</item>
  <item>\(-\frac{24}5d^3s^4\)</item>
  <item>\(-\frac{24}{30}d^3s^4\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis>\(-\frac{24}5d^3s^4\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="3" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((n-4)(3n+7)\)</item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(3n^2-19n+28\)</item>
  <item>\(3n^2-12n+28\)</item>
  <item>\(3n^2-5n-28\)</item>
  <item>\(3n^2+5n-28\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(3n^2-5n-28\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="4" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((3x^2+3)(7x-5)\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer: </emphasis> \(21x^3-15x^2+21x-15\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="5" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((m-6)(2m^2-7m+8)\) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(2m^3-7m^2+8m\)</item>
  <item>\(-6m^2-42m-48\)</item>
  <item>\(2m^3+19m^2+34m-48\)</item>
  <item>\(2m^3-19m^2+50m-48\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(2m^3-19m^2+50m-48\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="6" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((c-4)(c^2+5c-9)\) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(c^3+5c^2-9c\)</item>
  <item>\(c^3+c^2-29c+36\)</item>
  <item>\(-4c^2-20c+36\)</item>
  <item>\(-4c^3+c^2-29c+36\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(c^3+c^2-29c+36\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="7" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((5x - 3)^2\) </item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(25x^2-30x+9\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="8" type="enumerated">
  <item>\((11z + 7)(11z - 7)\) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(121z^2-144z-49\)</item>
  <item>\(121z^2-49\)</item>
  <item>\(121z^2+144z-49\)</item>
  <item>\(121z^2+49\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(121z^2-49\)</para>
<para>For questions 9–10, use the following polynomial functions.</para>
<list>
  <item>\(f(x) = 5x + 4v\)</item>
  <item>\(g(x) = 5x - 4v\)</item>
</list>

<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="9" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(f(x) \cdot g(x)\) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(25x^2+16v^2\)</item>
  <item>\(25x^2-40xv+16v^2\)</item>
  <item>\(25x^2+40xv+16v^2\)</item>
  <item>\(25x^2-16v^2\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(25x^2-16v^2\)</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" start="10" type="enumerated">
  <item>\(f(x) \cdot f(x)\) </item>
</list>
<list>
  <item>\(25x^2+16v^2\)</item>
  <item>\(25x^2-40xv+16v^2\)</item>
  <item>\(25x^2+40xv+16v^2\)</item>
  <item>\(25x^2-16v^2\)</item>
</list>
<para><emphasis>Answer:</emphasis> \(25x^2+40xv+16v^2\)</para>
</section>
</content>
